@startuml
title DineFlow - Payment Confirmation and Late Outcomes
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

autonumber
actor Customer
participant "PaymentService" as Payments
participant "OrderService" as Order
participant "PaymentProviderPort" as Provider
participant "POSIntegration" as POS
note over Customer,Order
Start: valid quoted pre-order; customer confirms payment.
P-PAY proposed; order/visit eligibility rechecked at initiation.
end note
Customer -> Payments : initiatePayment(orderId)
Payments -> Order : markAwaitingPayment(orderId)
alt Order/quote closed, already paid, or unresolved attempt exists
 Order --> Payments : reject initiation
 Payments --> Customer : no new attempt; current status / reconciliation needed
else Initiation accepted as one logical decision
 Order --> Payments : AWAITING_PAYMENT + validated amount/currency
 note over Payments : Register Payment INITIATED with stable attemptId.
 Payments -> Provider : initiate(attemptId, amount, currency)
 alt Result received
  Provider --> Payments : result event
  Payments -> Payments : handleProviderResult(event)
  Payments -> Provider : verifyResult(event)
  Provider --> Payments : verified success / rejection / non-final or untrusted
 else No definitive response before timeout
  Payments -> Payments : markUnknown(attemptId)
  Payments --> Customer : UNKNOWN; closing the app does not cancel payment
  opt Reconciliation when required by agreed policy
   Payments -> Payments : reconcilePayment(attemptId)
   Payments -> Provider : queryStatus(attemptId)
   Provider --> Payments : verified result / unresolved
  end
 end
 opt Checkout expires or reservation is cancelled/expires while unresolved
  Order -> Order : reviewUnresolved(orderId)
  note over Order : REVIEW_REQUIRED; no new attempt or fulfilment.
 end
 alt Verified success for expected attempt/amount/currency
  note over Payments : Payment = SUCCEEDED; retain financial truth once.
  Payments -> Order : acceptPaidOrder(orderId, attemptId)
  alt Order and reservation remain eligible
   Order --> Payments : PAID
   Order -> POS : deliverConfirmed(order reference)
   POS --> Order : DELIVERED / FAILED
   Order -> Order : recordDelivery(reference, result)
   note over Order : Failed delivery preserves PAID; recover separately.
   Payments --> Customer : payment succeeded + delivery status
  else Order/visit cancelled, expired, or otherwise ineligible
   Order --> Payments : REVIEW_REQUIRED
   note over Payments,Order
   No rebooking and no automatic restaurant handoff.
   Refund / review policy and owner remain D-04.
   end note
   Payments --> Customer : funds received; order requires review
  end
 else Verified rejection
  note over Payments,Order
  Payment = FAILED.
  Eligible order stays AWAITING_PAYMENT.
  Closed/ineligible order stays REVIEW_REQUIRED.
  Reservation lifecycle is unchanged.
  end note
  Payments --> Customer : payment rejected
 else No verified terminal result
  Payments -> Payments : markUnknown(attemptId)
  Payments --> Customer : UNKNOWN; reconcile; no new attempt
 end
 opt Late or duplicate provider event
  Provider -> Payments : handleProviderResult(event)
  Payments -> Provider : verifyResult(event)
  Provider --> Payments : verified outcome / reject
  note over Payments,Order
  Apply the same eligibility/outcome handling above.
  Late success on closed order -> REVIEW_REQUIRED.
  Replay unfinished effects, never duplicate or regress SUCCEEDED.
  end note
 end
end
note over Customer,Order
End: verified outcome or explicit UNKNOWN awaiting reconciliation.
Closing the app after initiation is not cancellation before payment.
No approved timeout, refund policy, or provider protocol is implied.
end note
legend bottom
P-PAY / P-INTEGRATION proposed; FR-008-FR-009; NFR-008; AC-002, AC-005-AC-006.
Reservation release follows its finite interval, independently of payment reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
